From 2e80911cb2e78c322b9b2a1a8b9d339bcaefe8e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:02:24 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Replace static guides with admin-managed blog

- Remove all 18 static guides (src/content/guides) and their OG route
- Add /admin/ (password login, signed httpOnly session): post list, editor with
  markdown toolbar + preview, featured/inline/social image upload, SEO fields
  (meta title/description, focus + secondary keywords, canonical, noindex/nofollow,
  schema type, OG/Twitter), FAQ builder, related tools, scheduling, live SEO score
  and Google/social previews
- File-backed store (posts.json + uploads) on a Docker named volume
- Public /blog/, /blog/page/N/, /blog/[slug]/ read posts at runtime with full
  metadata, BlogPosting + FAQPage JSON-LD, generated fallback OG image
- Sitemap includes published indexable posts with images; robots disallows /admin/
- Homepage shows latest posts; nav label Guides -> Blog

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XeKtFkgeds8ZdZ1x2M9zhm
